 { Thanks to his active rook Black is quite safe here, despite being a pawn down. However, it is not easy to find a solid move for him. } 1... { -KEY- } g6 $1 { Looking for pawn exchanges on the kingside. } ( { a) If } 1... Ra4 $6 2. Rd5 ) 
